  "© 2026 M-VAVE。APP 采用 GPLv3＋SDK 链接例外，可依许可修改和再分发，按现状提供，不提供担保。SDK 与第三方组件条款见下方声明。": "© 2026 M-VAVE. APP: GPLv3 with an SDK linking exception; modification and redistribution are permitted under its terms, without warranty. See below for SDK and third-party terms.",
